flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Set secret number]
    B --> C[/Enter a guess/]
    C --> D{Guess equals secret?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Display correct guess]
    D -- No --> F{Guess too low?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Display too low]
    F -- No --> H[Display too high]
    G --> C
    H --> C
    E --> I([Stop])
